WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.343 --> 00:00:10.644
Mrs. Blurrie was very old and lived alone.

2
00:00:11.305 --> 00:00:12.705
She liked living by herself.

3
00:00:13.326 --> 00:00:16.947
And though her children begged her to move in with them, she continued to live alone.

4
00:00:17.708 --> 00:00:22.450
One day her independence faced a problem, however, when she noticed that she could not see very well.

5
00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:26.852
She had been making pancakes for breakfast and thought she had added oil to the batter.

6
00:00:28.596 --> 00:00:32.458
However, when she put a bite of pancakes into her mouth, they tasted awful!

7
00:00:33.078 --> 00:00:35.279
She realized she had added soap by mistake!

8
00:00:35.299 --> 00:00:39.901
"I must get my eyes checked," she said to her favorite plant Harry.

9
00:00:40.481 --> 00:00:41.461
So she called Dr.

10
00:00:41.501 --> 00:00:44.783
Snatch that afternoon and asked him to come over and examine her eyes.

11
00:00:44.803 --> 00:00:49.545
"I will be there tomorrow morning at nine," the doctor said.

12
00:00:51.285 --> 00:00:52.906
At nine o'clock the doctor arrived.

13
00:00:53.466 --> 00:00:55.627
He pulled out his scopes and charts and checked Mrs.

14
00:00:55.667 --> 00:00:56.447
Blurrie's vision.

15
00:00:57.028 --> 00:01:01.682
He said "hmm" and "ohh" a lot.

16
00:01:02.282 --> 00:01:03.863
When she looked at his face, Mrs.

17
00:01:03.903 --> 00:01:07.524
Blurrie couldn't tell if he was rubbing his head or if it was growing.

18
00:01:08.164 --> 00:01:08.925
Even though Dr.

19
00:01:08.945 --> 00:01:11.206
Snatch was sitting close, he looked all blurry.

20
00:01:11.226 --> 00:01:15.047
"I have some bad news, Mrs.

21
00:01:15.127 --> 00:01:16.388
Blurrie," he said.

22
00:01:16.908 --> 00:01:22.590
"Your eyes are very old, and you are quickly going blind from a terrible disease."

23
00:01:22.610 --> 00:01:26.092
"Is there nothing you can do to make my eyes better?"

24
00:01:26.704 --> 00:01:27.765
Mrs. Blurrie pleaded.

25
00:01:27.785 --> 00:01:30.706
"Please, I will do anything!"

26
00:01:30.726 --> 00:01:37.229
"Well, I could do something, but it would be very expensive," Dr.

27
00:01:37.269 --> 00:01:37.869
Snatch said.

28
00:01:37.889 --> 00:01:40.890
"Oh, please.

29
00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:46.112
I will pay whatever you ask if you will only help me see again," she said.

30
00:01:46.132 --> 00:01:52.675
"Very well," he agreed, "but it will mean that I must come here every day for two weeks

31
00:01:52.735 --> 00:01:54.576
to give you a special treatment."

32
00:01:55.212 --> 00:01:58.214
"Agreed. You may come anytime you wish."

33
00:01:58.854 --> 00:02:00.675
Dr. Snatch shook hands with Mrs.

34
00:02:00.715 --> 00:02:01.876
Blurrie, and then he left.

35
00:02:04.137 --> 00:02:05.658
For the next two weeks, Dr.

36
00:02:05.718 --> 00:02:06.938
Snatch came to Mrs.

37
00:02:06.998 --> 00:02:08.399
Blurrie's house every day.

38
00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:12.962
He would begin by having her lie down on the couch for ten minutes with a cloth over

39
00:02:13.002 --> 00:02:14.623
her eyes to relax the muscles.

40
00:02:15.283 --> 00:02:18.945
Then he would remove the cloth and place a special lotion on her eyelids.

41
00:02:19.445 --> 00:02:23.387
Finally he would put some drops into her eyes and have her lie down in a dark room

42
00:02:23.447 --> 00:02:24.388
for thirty minutes.

43
00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:28.182
When the thirty minutes was over, Mrs.

44
00:02:28.222 --> 00:02:30.223
Blurrie would come out of her room, and Dr.

45
00:02:30.263 --> 00:02:31.204
Snatch would be gone.

46
00:02:31.804 --> 00:02:32.365
Though Mrs.

47
00:02:32.385 --> 00:02:35.447
Blurrie was very patient, she didn't seem to be getting better.

48
00:02:35.987 --> 00:02:40.650
In fact, after every treatment, she couldn't see anything except big shapes and colors.

49
00:02:41.211 --> 00:02:44.953
But every evening she would start to see a little better again, so Mrs.

50
00:02:44.993 --> 00:02:47.515
Blurrie told herself the medicine was starting to work.

51
00:02:49.937 --> 00:02:50.477
What Mrs.

52
00:02:50.517 --> 00:02:52.779
Blurrie didn't realize was that Dr.

53
00:02:52.819 --> 00:02:54.080
Snatch was deceiving her.

54
00:02:54.664 --> 00:02:57.505
He was covering her eyes and having her lie down to trick her.

55
00:02:58.065 --> 00:03:01.667
In fact, the drops that he put in her eyes made her see even worse for a few

56
00:03:01.707 --> 00:03:03.027
hours! Mrs.

57
00:03:03.087 --> 00:03:05.308
Blurrie didn't have a terrible eye disease.

58
00:03:05.909 --> 00:03:10.771
Dr. Snatch was making her vision worse so that he could steal from her while she couldn't see!

59
00:03:12.811 --> 00:03:13.912
On the last day Dr.

60
00:03:13.932 --> 00:03:16.513
Snatch came to visit, his medicines were different.

61
00:03:16.993 --> 00:03:18.114
He did not ask Mrs.

62
00:03:18.154 --> 00:03:19.154
Blurrie to lie down.

63
00:03:19.694 --> 00:03:21.435
He did not put lotion on her eyelids.

64
00:03:22.055 --> 00:03:23.756
And he did not put drops in her eyes.

65
00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:27.301
"You are finally ready for the last step, Mrs.

66
00:03:27.381 --> 00:03:29.382
Blurrie," he announced proudly.

67
00:03:29.402 --> 00:03:35.884
"I have saved you from an illness that would have made you blind, and now that the disease

68
00:03:35.984 --> 00:03:38.824
is gone, we can correct your vision."

69
00:03:40.525 --> 00:03:41.825
With that, Mrs.

70
00:03:41.885 --> 00:03:46.567
Blurrie heard the doctor remove something from a paper bag, and then she felt something heavy on her

71
00:03:46.607 --> 00:03:47.307
nose and ears.

72
00:03:47.847 --> 00:03:50.088
When she looked straight ahead, she could see perfectly!

73
00:03:50.916 --> 00:03:55.340
Mrs. Blurrie went over to the mirror to see someone she had not seen for a very long

74
00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:56.661
time: herself!

75
00:03:57.261 --> 00:03:59.643
In the mirror she saw that she was wearing glasses.

76
00:03:59.663 --> 00:04:06.809
"Why, it's just these glasses that are helping me see," she said, a little disappointed.

77
00:04:06.829 --> 00:04:12.994
"Yes, first we had to cure the disease that was in your eyes so that the glasses could

78
00:04:13.055 --> 00:04:15.537
work. And now you can see!"

79
00:04:16.277 --> 00:04:19.340
Dr. Snatch turned to his bag and pulled out a piece of paper.

80
00:04:19.956 --> 00:04:25.041
"Here is my bill for saving your sight," he said, handing her the paper as if he had

81
00:04:25.081 --> 00:04:26.342
done something very great.

82
00:04:26.362 --> 00:04:33.268
"My, that must have been very expensive medicine, but we did have an agreement.

83
00:04:33.869 --> 00:04:35.450
Let me go get some money."

84
00:04:36.011 --> 00:04:39.834
Mrs. Blurrie turned to go to the kitchen, where she hid her money in the cookie jar.

85
00:04:40.335 --> 00:04:43.097
When she looked at her kitchen, she noticed something strange.

86
00:04:43.718 --> 00:04:48.334
Mrs. Blurrie screamed, "My kitchen is empty!

87
00:04:48.814 --> 00:04:50.055
Where are my dishes?

88
00:04:50.636 --> 00:04:51.997
Where are my pictures?

89
00:04:52.457 --> 00:04:54.339
Where is my cookie jar?"

90
00:04:56.060 --> 00:05:00.424
All that was left on the counter were the soapy pancakes she had made two weeks ago and

91
00:05:00.484 --> 00:05:01.425
Harry, her plant.

92
00:05:01.945 --> 00:05:06.229
When she returned to her living room, she realized that valuables were missing there as well.

93
00:05:06.249 --> 00:05:08.310
"I have been robbed!"

94
00:05:08.991 --> 00:05:09.992
Mrs. Blurrie cried.

95
00:05:10.012 --> 00:05:12.014
"I cannot pay you, Dr.

96
00:05:12.074 --> 00:05:13.315
Snatch," Mrs.

97
00:05:13.355 --> 00:05:14.676
Blurrie said with suspicion.

98
00:05:16.196 --> 00:05:20.357
"I have been robbed, and everything I had that was valuable is gone."

99
00:05:20.377 --> 00:05:26.339
"I am sorry you cannot find what you are looking for, but you must pay me, Mrs.

100
00:05:26.379 --> 00:05:30.140
Blurrie. We had an agreement," he reminded her.

101
00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:34.921
"Yes, but I have nothing with which to pay you," she said.

102
00:05:34.941 --> 00:05:40.703
"Well, then, I will be forced to have the judge put you in prison for failing to pay

103
00:05:40.763 --> 00:05:41.543
your bills!"

104
00:05:41.983 --> 00:05:44.364
he said angrily, and he stomped out of the house.

105
00:05:46.184 --> 00:05:47.505
The very next day, Mrs.

106
00:05:47.565 --> 00:05:48.465
Blurrie and Dr.

107
00:05:48.545 --> 00:05:51.067
Snatch stood before a judge and told their stories.

108
00:05:51.087 --> 00:05:56.110
"Your Honor, this woman agreed to pay me if I helped her see again.

109
00:05:56.650 --> 00:06:00.812
Now that she can see, she tells me she cannot pay," Dr.

110
00:06:00.873 --> 00:06:01.533
Snatch said.

111
00:06:01.553 --> 00:06:03.714
"Is that true, Mrs.

112
00:06:03.814 --> 00:06:05.555
Blurrie?" the judge asked.

113
00:06:06.236 --> 00:06:08.397
"Yes, Your Honor, it is true.

114
00:06:09.818 --> 00:06:11.579
I did agree to pay Dr.

115
00:06:11.639 --> 00:06:13.600
Snatch if he helped me see again.

116
00:06:14.232 --> 00:06:19.097
But it is also true that we agreed I would not have to pay him if he did

117
00:06:19.217 --> 00:06:21.599
not restore my sight," Mrs.

118
00:06:21.679 --> 00:06:22.520
Blurrie replied.

119
00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:25.403
"Well, can you see or not?"

120
00:06:25.944 --> 00:06:26.784
the judge asked.

121
00:06:27.425 --> 00:06:29.227
"Sir, Dr.

122
00:06:29.347 --> 00:06:31.149
Snatch says I can see.

123
00:06:31.689 --> 00:06:35.633
However, I believe that I still cannot," she said.

124
00:06:35.653 --> 00:06:37.274
"Why is that?"

125
00:06:37.855 --> 00:06:38.576
asked the judge.

126
00:06:40.316 --> 00:06:46.319
"Your Honor, before I lost my sight I loved to look at all of the valuable things in

127
00:06:46.359 --> 00:06:51.581
my home: my silver, my china, my pictures, and my cookie jar.

128
00:06:52.061 --> 00:06:55.763
To this day, I cannot see any of those valuable things.

129
00:06:56.423 --> 00:07:01.045
Thus, I have not been healed, and I don't owe him anything," Mrs.

130
00:07:01.085 --> 00:07:01.945
Blurrie insisted.

131
00:07:01.965 --> 00:07:06.047
"I see your point," the judge said as he rubbed his chin.

132
00:07:06.067 --> 00:07:09.444
"Dr. Snatch, since Mrs.

133
00:07:09.524 --> 00:07:15.666
Blurrie is unable to see what she once loved to look upon, she has not been cured and

134
00:07:15.906 --> 00:07:17.027
owes you nothing.

135
00:07:17.647 --> 00:07:19.588
Thank you and have a nice day."

136
00:07:20.148 --> 00:07:23.109
And with that, the judge dismissed them from his court.

137
00:07:23.649 --> 00:07:26.090
Mrs. Blurrie went home and celebrated with Harry.

138
00:07:26.650 --> 00:07:32.292
Though she didn't have her valuables, she did have what was most valuable to her―the ability to see.
